<html>
    <body>
        <p>
            Hello,<br><br>
            An IP address was flagged as abusive on AbuseIPDB and was seen on RemoteLabz:<br><br>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>IP address:</strong> {{ ip }}</li>
                <li><strong>Abuse confidence score:</strong> {{ score }}/100 (alert threshold: {{ threshold }}/100)</li>
                <li><strong>Total reports:</strong> {{ totalReports|default(0) }}</li>
                <li><strong>Country:</strong> {{ countryCode|default('Unknown') }}</li>
                <li><strong>Last checked:</strong> {{ checkedAt }}</li>
            </ul>
            <br>
            AbuseIPDB report: <a href="{{ checkUrl }}">{{ checkUrl }}</a><br>
            Login logs: <a href="{{ url('login_logs') }}">{{ url('login_logs') }}</a><br><br>
            This alert is sent at most once per IP every {{ cooldownDays }} day(s) while the score stays above the threshold.<br><br>
            Regards,<br>
            The RemoteLabz team.
        </p>
    </body>
</html>
